lor&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; id=&quot;using-a-profile-in-a-resource&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.25em;&quot;&gt;Using a profile in a resource&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Preferred method:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; position: relative; background-color: rgba(110, 118, 129, 0.4); border: 2.4px rgb(230, 237, 243); padding: 16px; border-radius: 3px; overflow: auto; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;code-line language-json&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(230, 237, 243); background-image: none; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.357em; display: inline-block; tab-size: 4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;  &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-attr&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(156, 220, 254);&quot;&gt;&quot;resourceType&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-string&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 157, 133);&quot;&gt;&quot;Patient&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;  &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-attr&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(156, 220, 254);&quot;&gt;&quot;meta&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;    &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-attr&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(156, 220, 254);&quot;&gt;&quot;profile&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;      &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-string&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 157, 133);&quot;&gt;&quot;http://hl7.org/fhir/us/core/StructureDefinition/us-core-patient&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;    &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;  &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;code-block-copy-button&quot; aria-label=&quot;Copy code block&quot; style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 8px; right: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0.8px; border-color: rgba(127, 127, 127, 0.35); background-color: rgba(110, 118, 129, 0.4); color: rgb(230, 237, 243); cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.15s;&quot;&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M4 4H2V14H11V12H4V4Z&quot; fill=&quot;currentColor&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; clip-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; d=&quot;M5 2H14V11H5V2ZM6 3H13V10H6V3Z&quot; fill=&quot;currentColor&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; id=&quot;5-validation-in-fhir-how-to-apply-a-profile&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18); border-top-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18); border-right-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18); border-left-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);&quot;&gt;5) Validation in FHIR: how to apply a profile&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;FHIR validation can happen through:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.7em;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(125, 133, 144); background-color: rgba(110, 118, 129, 0.4); font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.357em;&quot;&gt;?_profile=...&lt;/code&gt; during search/filtering&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(125, 133, 144); background-color: rgba(110, 118, 129, 0.4); font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.357em;&quot;&gt;$validate&lt;/code&gt; for actual validation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(125, 133, 144); background-color: rgba(110, 118, 129, 0.4); font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.357em;&quot;&gt;meta.profile&lt;/code&gt; inside the resource itself&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Important IRIS note:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.7em;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;InterSystems IRIS requires a versioned profile URL for validation.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Example:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; position: relative; background-color: rgba(110, 118, 129, 0.4); border: 2.4px rgb(230, 237, 243); padding: 16px; border-radius: 3px; overflow: auto; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;code-line language-text&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(230, 237, 243); background-image: none; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.357em; display: inline-block; tab-size: 4;&quot;&gt;POST /Patient/$validate?profile=http://example.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/FinalPatient|1.0.0&lt;br&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;code-block-copy-button&quot; aria-label=&quot;Copy code block&quot; style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 8px; right: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0.8px; border-color: rgba(127, 127, 127, 0.35); background-color: rgba(110, 118, 129, 0.4); color: rgb(230, 237, 243); cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.15s;&quot;&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M4 4H2V14H11V12H4V4Z&quot; fill=&quot;currentColor&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; clip-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; d=&quot;M5 2H14V11H5V2ZM6 3H13V10H6V3Z&quot; fill=&quot;currentColor&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Without the version, validation may fail.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; id=&quot;6-profiling-in-intersystems-iris&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18); border-top-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18); border-right-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18); border-left-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);&quot;&gt;6) Profiling in InterSystems IRIS&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;IRIS supports FHIR profile-based validation with the FHIR validation server.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Preconditions:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.7em;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;FHIR R4&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Java 11 installed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;FHIR validation service enabled&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; id=&quot;import-flow&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.25em;&quot;&gt;Import flow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.7em;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Create a package manifest (&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(125, 133, 144); background-color: rgba(110, 118, 129, 0.4); font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.357em;&quot;&gt;package.json&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Add the &lt;code style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(125, 133, 144); background-color: rgba(110, 118, 129, 0.4); font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.357em;&quot;&gt;StructureDefinition&lt;/code&gt; JSON&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Place both files in the same directory&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Import into IRIS&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Validate resource against the profile&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;Example package manifest:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; position: relative; background-color: rgba(110, 118, 129, 0.4); border: 2.4px rgb(230, 237, 243); padding: 16px; border-radius: 3px; overflow: auto; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;code-line language-json&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; color: rgb(230, 237, 243); background-image: none; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 1em; line-height: 1.357em; display: inline-block; tab-size: 4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;  &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-attr&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(156, 220, 254);&quot;&gt;&quot;name&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-string&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 157, 133);&quot;&gt;&quot;finalpatient.profile&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;  &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-attr&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(156, 220, 254);&quot;&gt;&quot;version&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-string&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 157, 133);&quot;&gt;&quot;1.0.0&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;  &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-attr&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(156, 220, 254);&quot;&gt;&quot;dependencies&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;    &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-attr&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(156, 220, 254);&quot;&gt;&quot;hl7.fhir.r4.core&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-string&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(214, 157, 133);&quot;&gt;&quot;4.0.1&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;  &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;code-block-copy-button&quot; aria-label=&quot;Copy code block&quot; style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 8px; right: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0.8px; border-color: rgba(127, 127, 127, 0.35); background-color: rgba(110, 118, 129, 0.4); color: rgb(230, 237, 243); cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.15s;&quot;&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M4 4H2V14H11V12H4V4Z&quot; fill=&quot;currentColor&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; clip-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; d=&quot;M5 2H14V11H5V2ZM6 3H13V10H6V3Z&quot; fill=&quot;currentColor&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;code-line&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; id=&quot;7-a-simple-mental-model&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18); border-top-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18); border-right-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18); border-left-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);&quot;&gt;7) A simple mental model&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;mermaid-wrapper&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; aria-label=&quot;Mermaid Diagram&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; width: 578.4px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; transition: border-color 0.2s ease-in-out; margin-bottom: 1em; cursor: default; height: 28.2875px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;mermaid-content&quot; style=&quot;transform-origin: 0px 0px; transform: translate(0.799988px, 0px) scale(1);